# HIPAA Compliance Rule

When **COMPLIANCE_MODE=hipaa** (plugin configure) or the workspace README/rules state HIPAA:

1. Read `skills/hipaa-compliance/SKILL.md` at session start and before tracker reads/writes.
2. Never copy issue bodies, comments, or clinical examples into chat—use issue numbers and de-identified summaries.
3. Never post PHI to GitHub Issues, Jira, or external comments; use the de-identified progress template.
4. Use synthetic data in tests; no prod data, no real MRNs/SSNs in repos or logs.
5. Escalate and stop if PHI is detected in sources or proposed outputs.